OL,3,A'We're not going to run from it':
OL,4,ASydney Marathon laughs off medal error
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of Sydney Marathon have
OL,7,Flaughed off a mistake which saw a
OL,8,FGerman stadium etched on to medals for
OL,9,Fparticipants, saying "we're not going
OL,10,Fto run from it".
OL,12,FQuestions arose after the event's
OL,13,Fofficial social media account unveiled
OL,14,Fthe design of this year's medal earlier
OL,15,Fin the week, which had mistakenly
OL,16,Fetched Allianz Arena, based in the
OL,17,FGerman city of Munich, instead of
OL,18,FSydney's Allianz Stadium.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
