OL,3,A'We're not going to run from it':
OL,4,ASydney Marathon laughs off medal error
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Sydney Marathon
OL,7,Ftold the BBC: "A little too much
OL,8,Finternational flavour has found its way
OL,9,Fonto the back of the finishers medal,
OL,10,Fwith an incorrect depiction of the
OL,11,Fstadium."
OL,13,FIt was "an unfortunate error," they
OL,14,Fadded.
